### 1. Test App Version Compatibility (Should fail with 426 Upgrade Required)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-App-Version: 0.9.0

{
  "email": "superadmin@schore.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 2. Login (Should succeed and return access + refresh tokens)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-App-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "email": "superadmin@schore.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Keep the access token and refresh token from the login response.
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### 3. Bootstrap API (Should succeed using the access token and resolve multi-tenancy context)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-App-Version: 1.0.0

### 4. Refresh Tokens (Should succeed and return new access + refresh tokens)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-App-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Logout (Should succeed and revoke the session)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-App-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
